  "boundaries": [
    "A person agrees to the criteria before testing and signs off after it; an agent never records go or no-go.",
    "Runs use made-up data and read-only steps; a step that would submit, pay or create an account runs only on a test target a person named.",
    "Failed, blocked and not-run steps stay on the record; a rerun is a new session.",
    "Workers create nouns and propose verbs; an authorized requester enqueues the proposals worth doing.",
    "Importing the pack writes nothing and enqueues nothing."
  ],
